A '''Summoning Eye''' is an {{Epic}} item. It is primarily used for summoning the {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon}} in the {{Zone|Dragon's Nest}}. 

== Obtaining ==
=== Special Zealot ===
{{Main|Zealot#Special Zealots|Zealot#Increasing Spawn Chances}}

When a player kills a {{MobSprite|Zealot}} or {{MobSprite|Zealot Bruiser}}, there is a small chance that a {{MobSprite|Special Zealot}} will spawn nearby: this is telegraphed by a message displaying {{Rmt|&cSPECIAL ZEALOT}} on their screen. Additionally, the following dialogue will display in chat:
{{Dialogue|&cA special &5Zealot &chas spawned nearby!}}

{{MobSprite|Special Zealot}}s have a {{o|g}} chance to drop {{Item|Summoning Eye|amount=1}}.

The [[Tyzzo|{{AN|Dragon Piper}}]] perk and {{Attr|Special Upgrades}} [[Attribute]] grant a {{Green|+5%}} and {{Green|+0.5}}-{{Green|5%}} chance to be [[Recombobulator 3000|recombobulated]], up to a {{Green|10%}} chance. Upon one of those activating, the following dialogue appears in chat:
{{Dialogue|&a&lDRAGON PIPER! &eYour &6Summoning Eye &ehas been recombobulated!}}
{{Dialogue|&a&lSPECIAL UPGRADES! &eYour &6Summoning Eye &ehas been recombobulated!}}

=== Voidgloom Seraph ===
A '''Summoning Eye''' is an {{o|e|no=y}} drop obtained from {{MobSprite|Voidgloom Seraph}} {{SlayerTier|II}}+ if the player has unlocked {{Coll|Enderman Slayer 1}}. 

;Drop Chances
*{{Stier|2}}: {{Chance|0.67%|1|148.5}}
*{{Stier|3}}: {{Chance|0.6%|1|167.75}}
*{{Stier|4}}: {{Chance|0.56%|1|177.11}}

=== Voidling Extremist ===
A '''Summoning Eye''' is a {{o|l l|no=y}} drop obtained from {{MobSprite|Voidling Extremist}} with {{Green|0.04%}} chance.

=== Draconic Altar ===
A '''Summoning Eye''' has a {{Mctxt|d|Very Rare}} chance to be obtained by sacrificing the following items at the [[Draconic Altar]]:
*Any [[Dragon Armor]]: {{Green|4.82%}}
*{{Item|Ender Armor}} and Equipment: {{Green|1%}}
*{{Item|End Stone Bow}}: {{Green|1%}}
*{{Item|Obsidian Chestplate}}: {{Green|1.05%}}
*{{Item|Aspect of the Dragons}}: {{Green|4.71%}}

=== Raffle of the Century ===
'''Summoning Eye''' can also be obtained as a {{Yellow|'''MINOR'''}} reward from [[Raffle of the Century]], or from the {{Item|Gift Bag of the Century}}.

== Usage ==
=== Ender Altar ===
'''Summoning Eyes''' are used at the [[Ender Altar]] to summon a {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon}}, of which there are {{Green|7}} types. Interacting with an empty {{Item|End Portal Frame|link=}} will place the '''Summoning Eye''' and convert it to a {{Item|Sleeping Eye}}. A total of {{Item|Summoning Eye|amount=8}}s are required to summon an {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon}}: once an {{MobSprite|Ender Dragon}} is summoned, all {{Item|Sleeping Eye}}s are converted to {{Item|Remnant of the Eye|text=Remnants of the Eye}}.

Placing Recombobulated {{Item|Summoning Eye}}s grant a greater chance to spawn a {{MobSprite|Superior Dragon}}.

