=== Stranded ===
{{Exclusive/Stranded}}
A '''Summoning Eye''' can be used as a minion upgrade for the {{Item|Enderman Minion}}, allowing it to spawn {{MobSprite|Zealot}}s instead, at the cost of a {{Green|2x}} reduction in the minion's speed.

== Trivia ==
*The addition of guaranteeing a {{MobSprite|Superior Dragon}} from applying {{Item|Recombobulator 3000}}s to '''Summoning Eyes''' is a reference to {{RN|yt|Refraction}}, who recombobulated '''Summoning Eyes''' in the hopes of getting a Superior Dragon.
*Prior to [[Changelog/2021/May 31|v0.11.4]], there was a {{Green|5s}} pickup priority before a player can take a different player's {{MobSprite|Special Zealot}}'s '''Summoning Eye'''.

